This project references the research paper:
"Open Deep Search: Democratizing Search with Open-source Reasoning Agents"
by Salaheddin Alzubi et al., available at: https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.20201

This project utilizes components from the following open-source projects:
- SmolAgents (https://huggingface.co/docs/smolagents/index)
- Crawl4AI (https://github.com/unclecode/crawl4ai)
- Infinity Embedding API (https://github.com/michaelfeil/infinity)
- LiteLLM (https://www.litellm.ai/)
